  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Achaea: village between Aigion and Pellene</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An unlocated ancient settlement in Achaea, mentioned by Strabo, that Camp (BAtlDir) considers distinct from the Pellene now identified with modern Zugra and lying between it and Aigion (which still bears its ancient name today).",
